यक्रमों, शिक्षकों और परिणामों के साथ।</p><p><a href="https://app.example.test/public/disclosure/zz-hill">अनिवार्य प्रकटीकरण पढ़ें</a></p></div></section><section id="admissions" aria-labelledby="h-admissions"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-admissions">प्रवेश</h2><p>Forms in January.</p><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/admissions">आवेदन कैसे करें</a></p></div></section><section id="news" aria-labelledby="h-news"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-news">समाचार</h2><ul class="news"><li><article><div><h3>Annual day</h3><time datetime="2026-10-10">10 अक्टूबर 2026</time><p>Songs and a play.</p></div></article></li></ul><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/news">सारे समाचार</a></p></div></section><section id="gallery" aria-labelledby="h-gallery"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-gallery">चित्र दीर्घा</h2><ul class="gallery"><li><img src="/api/files/f-album?w=640" alt="A race" loading="lazy"></li></ul><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/gallery">सारे चित्र</a></p></div></section><section id="contact" aria-labelledby="h-contact"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-contact">संपर्क करें</h2><dl class="contact"><dt>पता</dt><dd>2 Hill Road, Nashik, Maharashtra, 422001</dd><dt>फ़ोन</dt><dd><a href="tel:+912531234567">+91 253 123 4567</a></dd><dt>ई-मेल</dt><dd><a href="mailto:office@zz-hill.test">office@zz-hill.test</a></dd></dl><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/contact">संपर्क करें</a></p></div></section><section id="events" aria-labelledby="h-events"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-events">आयोजन</h2><ul class="events"><li><strong>Diwali break</strong><span class="when"><time datetime="2026-10-20">20 अक्टूबर 2026 – 27 अक्टूबर 2026</time></span><span class="kind">छुट्टी</span></li></ul><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/events">सारे आयोजन</a></p></div></section><section id="achievements" aria-labelledby="h-achievements"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-achievements">उपलब्धियाँ</h2><ul class="cards"><li><div class="body"><h3>District science fair, first place</h3><span class="when"><time datetime="2026-09-12">12 सितंबर 2026</time></span><p>The Grade 8 team&#39;s water filter.</p></div></li></ul><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/achievements">सब देखें</a></p></div></section><section id="facilities" aria-labelledby="h-facilities"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-facilities">सुविधाएँ</h2><ul class="cards"><li><img src="/api/files/f-library?w=640" alt="Shelves of books" loading="lazy"><div class="body"><h3>पुस्तकालय</h3><p>Six thousand books.</p></div></li><li><div class="body"><h3>Music room</h3></div></li></ul><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/facilities">सब देखें</a></p></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap"><p>ZZ Hill School · 2 Hill Road, Nashik, Maharashtra, 422001</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/zz-hill" rel="noopener">फ़ेसबुक</a></li><li><a href="https://youtu.be/zz" rel="noopener">यूट्यूब</a></li><li><a href="https://wa.me/919800000000" rel="noopener">व्हॉट्सऐप</a></li><li><a href="https://app.example.test/public/disclosure/zz-hill">अनिवार्य प्रकटीकरण</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://app.example.test">शालाघर से बनी वेबसाइट</a></p></div></footer></body></html>"`;

