SE__/about">About us</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/academics">Academics</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/admissions" aria-current="page">Admissions</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/facilities">Facilities</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/gallery">Gallery</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/news">News</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/events">Events</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/achievements">Achievements</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/downloads">Downloads</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/contact">Contact</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/transport-routes">Bus routes</a></li></ul></nav><nav aria-label="Language"><ul class="langs"><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/admissions?lang=en" lang="en" aria-current="page">English</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/admissions?lang=hi" lang="hi" hreflang="hi">हिन्दी</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/admissions?lang=mr" lang="mr" hreflang="mr">मराठी</a></li></ul></nav></div></header><main id="main"><section id="admissions" aria-labelledby="h-admissions"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-admissions">Admissions</h2><p>Forms in January.</p><div class="cycle"><h3>Admissions 2027</h3><dl class="facts"><dt>Opens</dt><dd>1 November 2026</dd><dt>Closes</dt><dd>31 January 2027</dd><dt>Classes</dt><dd>Grade 1, Grade 5</dd></dl></div><p><a href="/api/files/f-prospectus">Download the prospectus</a> <span class="note">PDF, 200 KB</span></p><form class="enquiry" method="post" action="/enquiry"><h3>Ask about admission</h3><input type="hidden" name="lang" value="en"><label>Your name<input name="name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Your phone or email<input name="contact" required maxlength="200" autocomplete="tel"></label><label>Your email (optional)<input name="email" type="email" maxlength="200" autocomplete="email"></label><label>Class you are asking about (optional)<input name="grade" maxlength="60"></label><label>Your question<textarea name="message" required maxlength="2000" rows="4"></textarea></labe